+/// Extra status/trait points a RECRUITED companion gains per level-up, granted
+/// only from 3rd job onward (1st/2nd/trans keep the stock economy so the growth
+/// ramp stays visible). The stock table grants ~4,051 points over a whole
+/// career, which caps a build near 130; a 4th-job companion target of
+/// 2x200 + 4x130 needs ~68/level on top of that. 0 restores stock behaviour.
+int32 population_engine_companion_points_per_level;
